# ON MAIN this reads `mobile/`: the Android app lives on this local-only branch
# and must never reach the public repo, so main ignores it to stop a `git add -A`
# sweeping it in. HERE it must stay tracked — this branch is where it lives.
# Merging main will conflict on these lines every time; keep THIS version.
# Build outputs, though, stay out: a debug APK is a 4MB artifact that changes on
# every build, and a debug-signed one has no business on a public branch.
mobile/node_modules/
mobile/dist/
mobile/*.apk
mobile/android/build/
mobile/android/app/build/
mobile/android/.gradle/
mobile/android/app/src/main/assets/public/
# Heavy social-media images (not referenced by the app or README)
branding/x-*.png
branding/x-*.svg
mobile/node_modules/
mobile/dist/
